WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.564 --> 00:00:14.509
(electronic music)

00:00:17.798 --> 00:00:18.623
- Hey.

00:00:18.623 --> 00:00:20.039
Did you eat my burrito?

00:00:20.039 --> 00:00:22.180
- Oh I don't want to taco bout it.

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:22.676
- Why?

00:00:22.676 --> 00:00:24.058
- I was hungry. I'll pay you back.

00:00:24.058 --> 00:00:25.242
- That's not the point.

00:00:25.242 --> 00:00:27.042
- Am I not entitled to nourishment?

00:00:27.042 --> 00:00:29.016
- I mean I didn't deny you shelter

00:00:29.016 --> 00:00:30.131
before you got your job.

00:00:30.131 --> 00:00:30.897
- I was hungry.

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:32.093
- Yeah now you know how I felt.

00:00:32.093 --> 00:00:33.440
- And why did you roll a sock up in it

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:34.044
and put it back?

00:00:34.044 --> 00:00:35.206
- Well I didn't want you
to think like a rodent

00:00:35.206 --> 00:00:36.553
had taken it or something.

00:00:36.553 --> 00:00:38.434
That way you know it was me.

00:00:39.554 --> 00:00:43.034
(TV playing)

00:00:43.034 --> 00:00:47.835
(electronic music)

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:51.031
(phone ringing)

00:00:52.787 --> 00:00:53.405
- Yo.

00:00:53.405 --> 00:00:54.427
- [Voiceover] What the hell man.

00:00:54.427 --> 00:00:55.112
- What?

00:00:55.112 --> 00:00:56.923
- [Voiceover] You're eating my pizza.

00:00:56.923 --> 00:00:57.574
- Where are you?

00:00:57.574 --> 00:00:59.245
- I'm out getting froyo.

00:00:59.245 --> 00:01:00.406
- How do you see me?

00:01:00.406 --> 00:01:01.753
- I set up a camera.

00:01:01.753 --> 00:01:04.098
- You just watch this while
you're out getting froyo?

00:01:04.098 --> 00:01:05.945
- Yeah I'm a student
of the human condition.

00:01:05.945 --> 00:01:08.034
- Don't set up a camera in our apartment!

00:01:08.034 --> 00:01:09.195
- [Voiceover] Don't eat my pizza.

00:01:09.195 --> 00:01:11.963
- Well I was totally gonna
replace it with socks.

00:01:11.963 --> 00:01:13.201
- Multicam system yo.

00:01:13.201 --> 00:01:13.990
I can still see you.

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:15.674
- Oh yeah. What am I doing now?

00:01:15.674 --> 00:01:17.199
- Jerking off a ghost.

00:01:17.199 --> 00:01:19.103
Screenshotted. Bye!

00:01:19.103 --> 00:01:20.775
- Fuck you. Fuck you!

00:01:20.775 --> 00:01:23.702
(electronic music)

00:01:23.702 --> 00:01:25.861
Fuck you.

00:01:25.861 --> 00:01:26.581
Oh my God.

00:01:26.581 --> 00:01:27.881
I hope Bubbles is OK.

00:01:27.881 --> 00:01:32.202
- Well genetically speaking
pugs are never officially OK.

00:01:32.202 --> 00:01:33.619
- Smushed face and all.

00:01:33.619 --> 00:01:36.057
- But he kills it on Instagram.

00:01:36.057 --> 00:01:36.869
- To Bubbles!

00:01:36.869 --> 00:01:38.332
- To Bubbles.

00:01:38.332 --> 00:01:41.221
- Pasta should be ready any minute.

00:01:41.221 --> 00:01:43.522
This is Preston, my roommate.

00:01:43.522 --> 00:01:45.507
He promised he was going
to stay in his room.

00:01:45.507 --> 00:01:46.378
- Hi Preston!

00:01:46.378 --> 00:01:48.352
- Hasta la vista.

00:01:48.352 --> 00:01:50.833
- You don't have to talk to him.

00:01:50.833 --> 00:01:52.753
- I'm so impressed that you cook.

00:01:52.753 --> 00:01:54.518
The last guy I dated didn't even know

00:01:54.518 --> 00:01:56.491
how to microwave anything.

00:01:56.491 --> 00:01:57.606
- It's just pasta.

00:01:57.606 --> 00:01:58.952
The sauce is from a jar.

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:00.938
- At least it's not ketchup.

00:02:00.938 --> 00:02:03.337
- Just a second. It should
be just about ready.

00:02:07.289 --> 00:02:09.124
Do you like parmesan cheese on your pasta?

00:02:09.124 --> 00:02:10.308
Goes great with the sauce.

00:02:10.308 --> 00:02:11.933
- Whatever the chef recommends.

00:02:11.933 --> 00:02:13.489
- Chef's getting some tonight.

00:02:13.489 --> 00:02:15.169
- Huh?
- [Man] Nothing.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:22.388
(electronic music)

00:02:23.752 --> 00:02:24.816
- What?

00:02:24.816 --> 00:02:26.650
It's a poor man's Bloody Mary.

00:02:26.650 --> 00:02:28.097
I'll pay you back.

00:02:31.156 --> 00:02:32.963
- I'm sorry we don't have any butter.

00:02:35.512 --> 00:02:37.005
- It looks good.

00:02:38.357 --> 00:02:40.052
- We'll go out next time.

00:02:40.052 --> 00:02:43.465
(electronic music)

00:02:43.465 --> 00:02:45.126
Preston what happened? Are you.

00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:49.926
- That's kind of sweet.

00:02:49.926 --> 00:02:52.139
- He texted me that the
apartment was on fire.

00:02:53.491 --> 00:02:56.463
- He was trying to surprise you.

00:02:56.463 --> 00:03:01.457
(classical music)

00:03:03.127 --> 00:03:04.196
- I guess it is kind of sweet

00:03:04.196 --> 00:03:07.766
in the most bizarre way possible.

00:03:09.351 --> 00:03:11.146
Your chair madam.

00:03:17.596 --> 00:03:18.868
Fruit drink?

00:03:20.847 --> 00:03:21.900
Preston's right.

00:03:23.367 --> 00:03:25.755
Lucky Charm marshmallows do
make a delicious dessert.

00:03:27.641 --> 00:03:30.237
- I have something else in mind.

00:03:33.748 --> 00:03:35.456
(electronic music)

00:03:35.456 --> 00:03:36.951
- Son of a bitch.

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:44.561
- [Voiceover] Bro.

00:03:44.561 --> 00:03:49.152
(electronic music)

